<title>UK: SOCCER-BASTIA STRIKER LAURENT JOINS LEEDS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BASTIA STRIKER LAURENT JOINS LEEDS.</headline>
<dateline>LEEDS, England 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>French striker Pierre Laurent signed a four-year deal with Leeds United on Thursday, subject to a medical.</p>
<p>The uncapped Laurent was nearing the end of his contract with Corsican side Bastia and Leeds took advantage of the Bosman ruling to sign him at a knockdown price of around 250,000 pounds ($407,000).</p>
<p>Laurent was expected to make his English premier league debut against Blackburn on April 7.</p>
